ct my monthly Audi payment?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Trade-in equity acts as an additional down payment, reducing your principal balance financed and lowering total interest costs over the life of the loan.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n      <span>Are maintenance plans included in auto loan calculations?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Maintenance plans and warranty packages are optional add-ons. If financed into your loan, they increase monthly payment amounts and total interest accrual.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n      <span>Can I calculate bi-weekly payments for Audi loans?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Yes, our calculator supports bi-weekly amortization, allowing you to make 26 half-payments per year for faster principal payoff and interest savings.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n      <span>Does the Audi Finance Calculator support foreign currencies?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Yes, you can toggle between USD ($), CAD (CA$), GBP (\u00a3), and INR (\u20b9) seamlessly, updating calculations automatically across all currency formats.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Disclaimer & Terms of Use</h2>\n<p>All calculations, loan payment figures, and interest estimates provided by the Audi Finance Calculator are intended strictly for educational and self-planning purposes. FinancersLot is an independent financial tool platform and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or partnered with Audi AG or Audi Financial Services. Actual financing terms, interest rates, and loan approvals 