irectly reducing principal balance financed and lowering cumulative interest charges over the loan term.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n      <span>Can I calculate bi-weekly payments for Ford truck loans?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Yes, our calculator supports bi-weekly amortization schedules, allowing you to make 26 half-payments per year for accelerated debt payoff and interest savings.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n      <span>Should I finance dealer documentation and sales tax into the loan?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Financing fees and taxes increases your loan principal and total interest cost. Paying fees upfront in cash reduces overall borrowing expenses.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n      <span>Does the Ford Finance Calculator support multi-currency switching?</span>\n      <span>\u25bc</span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n      Yes, you can toggle between USD ($), CAD (CA$), GBP (\u00a3), and INR (\u20b9) seamlessly, with automatic calculation updates across currencies.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Disclaimer & Terms of Use</h2>\n<p>Before signing final dealership financing contracts, carefully inspect the Truth in Lending Act (TILA) disclosure form provided by your lender. The TILA disclosure clearly itemizes your exact APR interest rate, total finance charge in dollars, total amount financed, and cumulative loan payments. Comparing these numbers against our calculator outputs prevents unexpected dealer fee markups.</p>\n<p>All calculations, payment estimates, and schedule breakdowns provided by the Ford Finance Calculator are intended strictly for educatio